properties.summary:
Anthony took the recommendations on items 17–25 and on the judgement pass's surprises. Recorded now:
- delegation deferred;
- recency keyed to a revision, not a clock;
- no new field for qualified check results;
- the physical-numbers dividing line set and its build deferred;
- the four OAuth client choices (official SDK auth, browser at setup only, keychain with a one-time warning, a domain reflow2 controls, which is still to be chosen);
- both owners named in writing;
- the additive-only promise amended to "never removed without a release of notice";
- an advisory rule that an idea from reading waits for a real use.

Accepted and recorded when they are carried out:
- merge survivor: the engine proposes and a person picks, after a root-cause pass;
- follow-through: a link between two findings reads as precedent, once it is confirmed that an unacted finding is still reported elsewhere;
- undelivered accepted requirements: link those already built, then keep, defer or drop against the few-jobs yardstick;
- built-but-open work: draw the missing links before he rules;
- the proposed rejections of reading-only ideas.
